    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS An investment in shares of our common stock involves risks. You should specifically consider the following material risks in addition to the other\ninformation contained in this prospectus before you decide to purchase shares of our common stock. The occurrence of any of the following risks might cause you to lose all or a significant part of your investment. The risks and uncertainties\ndiscussed below are not the only ones we face, but do represent all known risks and uncertainties that we believe are material to our business, operating results, financial condition, prospects and forward-looking statements. Risks Related to This Offering and Our Organizational Structure We have a limited operating history, and there is no assurance that we will be able to achieve our investment objectives. We have a limited operating history and may not be able to achieve our investment obje",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
